  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Spatial Data Services in the Republic of Moldova following EU standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the overall project is to contribute to the availability of improved, relevant, and trustable spatial information available for the public and businesses on properties, infrastructures and environmental issues in Moldova. This is achieved by strengthening the Agency for Land Relations and Cadastre (ALRC) of Moldova and related institutions in a project of 22 months. This project provides additional co-financing to enable the input of Dutch expertise in this EU-funded Twinning project.</narrative>
  </description>
